{"color":"DEFAULT","isTrashed":false,"isPinned":false,"isArchived":false,"textContent":"\n```javascript\nfunction createTrustManagementWorkbook() {\n  // Create a new spreadsheet\n  var spreadsheet = SpreadsheetApp.create(\"Trust Management Workbook\");\n  var sheet = spreadsheet.getActiveSheet();\n  \n  // Set up headers\n  sheet.getRange(\"A1:C1\").setValues([[\"Year\", \"Task\", \"Status\"]]);\n  \n  // Define years and tasks\n  var startYear = 2000;\n  var endYear = 2025;\n  var tasks = [\n    \"Review Trust Document\",\n    \"Check Financial Statements\",\n    \"Verify Distributions\",\n    \"Assess Investments\"\n  ];\n  \n  // Populate data\n  var data = [];\n  for (var year = startYear; year <= endYear; year++) {\n    for (var i = 0; i < tasks.length; i++) {\n      data.push([year, tasks[i], \"Pending\"]);\n    }\n  }\n  \n  // Write data to sheet\n  sheet.getRange(2, 1, data.length, 3).setValues(data);\n  \n  // Auto-resize columns\n  sheet.autoResizeColumns(1, 3);\n  \n  // Log the URL of the new spreadsheet\n  Logger.log(\"Spreadsheet URL: \" + spreadsheet.getUrl());\n}\n```","title":"","userEditedTimestampUsec":1727709104550000,"createdTimestampUsec":1727709104550000,"textContentHtml":"<br /><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:7.2pt;font-family:'Google Sans';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">```javascript<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:7.2pt;font-family:'Google Sans';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">function createTrustManagementWorkbook() {<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;mar